### ========================================
### ✅ POST - Create User (Success Cases)
### ========================================

### Create user - Charlie (valid)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Charlie",
    "email": "charlie@example.com",
    "password": "pass1234"
}

### Create user - David with role
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "David",
    "email": "david@example.com",
    "password": "pass5678",
    "role": "admin"
}

### Create user - Emma
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Emma",
    "email": "emma@example.com",
    "password": "pass9012"
}


### ========================================
### ❌ POST - Create User (Error Cases)
### ========================================

### Missing username (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "noname@example.com",
    "password": "pass1234"
}

### Missing email (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "NoEmail",
    "password": "pass1234"
}

### Missing password (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "NoPassword",
    "email": "nopass@example.com"
}

### Password too short (should fail - minlength: 8)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ShortPass",
    "email": "short@example.com",
    "password": "123"
}

### Duplicate email (should fail - run after creating Charlie)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Charlie2",
    "email": "charlie@example.com",
    "password": "pass1234"
}


### ========================================
### ✅ PUT - Update User (Success Case)
### ========================================

### Update user (แทนที่ YOUR_USER_ID_HERE ด้วย MongoDB _id จริง)
PUT http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users/YOUR_USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "CharlieUpdated",
    "email": "charlie.updated@example.com",
    "password": "newpass1234"
}

### Update user with role
PUT http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users/YOUR_USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "CharlieAdmin",
    "email": "charlie.admin@example.com",
    "password": "adminpass123",
    "role": "admin"
}


