Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "updated@example.com",
    "password": "pass1234"
}

### Update with missing password (should fail)
PUT http://localhost:3002/api/V2/users/YOUR_USER_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Updated",
    "email": "updated@example.com"
}

